  lore:
  - id: freelance/1/0
    title: Maintenance testimony
    company: MORROW FINANCIAL
    contract: Friendly Correction
    text: Morrow's reconciliation team keeps a private tally of corrected accounts. Each entry is a household that no longer has to call the help line.
  - id: freelance/1/1
    title: An unofficial record
    company: MORROW FINANCIAL
    contract: Friendly Correction
    text: A branch manager quietly waived fees during the outage. Central accounting demanded an explanation. The response was a photograph of the flooded street.
  - id: freelance/1/2
    title: What the archive kept
    company: MORROW FINANCIAL
    contract: Friendly Correction
    text: An old Morrow training guide says a ledger is a promise to remember accurately. Someone has highlighted that sentence on every surviving copy.
